      "content": "it's not just about the money though. it's the way they look at me when i can't fix things. i can see it in their eyes. like they're constantly bracing for the next thing to go wrong because of me. if i was gone, that tension would just... vanish. they wouldn't have to worry about me anymore. they could just live.",
